1
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:57,880
I've tried countless times to sink this memory into the deep sea.

2
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:00,880
But whenever I'm alone,

3
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:04,380
the bubbles from the bottom of the sea always bubble up.

4
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,440
They whisper in my ear,

5
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:10,240
'You're dirty. Nobody loves you anymore.'

6
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:12,880
'You'll always be that little girl shivering in front of the closet,

7
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:15,040
unloved by anyone.'

8
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,560
Li Zhiwei.

9
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:31,280
What's wrong?

10
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,440
I'm having an episode again.

11
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,610
I can't control myself.

12
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:41,360
Everything will be fine when it's twelve o'clock.

13
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:41,820
Party A:

14
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,930
Isn't this what you've always dreamed of?

15
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:48,020
Why are you burning it?

16
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:56,040
If I hadn't gotten Lao Dai's copyright fee,

17
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:58,360
if 'The Death of Marat' hadn't been nominated,

18
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,880
would you still be with me?

19
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:04,210
I took it seriously a long time ago.

20
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:06,800
I treated you as my second life.

21
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:08,800
We agreed,

22
00:04:09,720 --> 00:04:10,980
until death do us part.

23
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:14,920
What was that bottle of Botox?

24
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,040
It wasn't me.

25
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,360
I wouldn't hurt Xiaofei.

26
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:25,000
Xiaofei ingested a lethal dose of Botox.

27
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:28,920
His muscles and brain have completely melted.

28
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:30,200
Sophie.

29
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,440
Ever since I met you,

30
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,840
you've been getting cosmetic treatments.

31
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:37,600
Just check the drug residue on that cake

32
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,840
and your recent purchase history,

33
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:40,770
and everything will come to light.

34
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:47,280
So that drugged cake,

35
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,440
was it meant for me?

36
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:54,400
The one who deserves to die is An'an.

37
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,620
You think she's a good person?

38
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:58,680
She's much more terrifying than you imagine.

39
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:00,440
Do you know how much I hate her?

40
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,920
The kind of hate where I want to trample her in the mud,

41
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:04,120
crush her, and eat her bite by bite.

42
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,920
If it weren't for her,

43
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:10,320
I wouldn't have suffered so much since childhood,

44
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,720
and Xiaofei wouldn't have died.

45
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,200
Mala wouldn't leave either.

46
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:17,650
You are the one who really killed Xiaofei.

47
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,920
Wake up.

48
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,200
I am not Mala.

49
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:23,120
And don't become the next him.

50
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:25,000
So what if you know?

51
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:29,600
I've had enough of feeling corrupted and broken.

52
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:33,720
I drugged him.

53
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:36,640
I accidentally killed Xiaofei.

54
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:40,720
I deserve it.

55
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,040
Sophie.

56
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:03,080
Li Zhiwei.

57
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,760
What happened?

58
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,640
He pushed me.

59
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,160
He pushed me.

60
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,200
He pushed me.

61
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,760
Did you push her?

62
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:19,040
I didn't.

63
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:23,320
Please stay away from us.

64
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:26,920
You are the only dangerous person in this house right now.

65
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,900
It's not even twelve o'clock yet.

66
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:56,730
Everything is already out of control.

67
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,080
If things keep going like this,

68
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,080
not only Xiaotao,

69
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:04,370
but Sophie and An'an might also be killed.

70
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:06,960
I have to go back.

71
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,130
I still have a chance

72
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:12,170
to go back before everything gets out of control.

73
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:22,050
It's still eleven o'clock.

74
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:29,980
Eleven o'clock again.

75
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:36,450
Eleven o'clock.

76
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:40,930
Why is it still eleven o'clock?

77
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:42,800
What went wrong?

78
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:47,800
Because your mind is already confused.

79
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,480
Are you ready to die now?

80
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:22,640
My time has long been different from the objective time of the universe outside.

81
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:24,080
So Mara said

82
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,040
his birthday is later than ours,

83
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:27,560
but he is older than us.

84
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:30,120
It's the result of his time travels.

85
00:08:30,880 --> 00:08:31,880
One last time.

86
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:34,520
Let's try one last time.

87
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:55,520
I hope we can all stay awake

88
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:58,760
until someone comes to the island to rescue us

89
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:00,690
and everything returns to normal.

90
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:05,090
Have some floral tea first.

91
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:10,120
You don't have to be so nice to me.

92
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:11,920
I won't thank you.

93
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,640
You still hate me.

94
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,700
Isn't it normal for me to hate you?

95
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:18,480
You were so cold back then

96
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,840
and did nothing.

97
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:21,240
I'm sorry.

98
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:24,080
At that time,

99
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,480
I was just a child.

100
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:34,760
At that time,

101
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:38,480
I was also just a child.

102
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:51,600
It's Mala.

103
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:53,280
Mala is really back.
